  "description": "VUCWUO crystallizes in the tetragonal crystal system with space group P 4/n. Reported CIF formula moiety: C144 H168 Eu9 N16 O42 1-,H3 O1 1+,2(H2 O1). From the CIF bond table, Eu1 (Eu) has 10 O neighbors; Eu2 (Eu) has 7 O neighbors; Eu3 (Eu) has 7 O neighbors; Eu4 (Eu) has 7 O neighbors; Eu5 (Eu) has 7 O neighbors; Eu6 (Eu) has 7 O neighbors; Eu7 (Eu) has 7 O neighbors; Eu8 (Eu) has 7 O neighbors; Eu9 (Eu) has 7 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 20 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.675-5.215 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 86.04-172.72°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C144H173Eu9N16O44. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 8 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)), 2 μ5-O (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
